      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Gods... what a fool I have been."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Delfador",
            x: 13,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Whitefangs, Blackcrests. Saurians, Arand. I really thought I was doing something great; fighting the good fight for king and country."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("But when it really mattered, I couldn’t see past my own ego. What kind of man was I? What kind of <b><i>friend</i></b> was I?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$horselord_id",
            text: _("’tis a dark day indeed. Orcs rampage across the countryside, pillaging and looting, while the false King Eldred does nothing. Worse than nothing: he marches on our own settlements, consolidating his power!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$horselord_id",
            text: _("Our king has perished, our kingdom in peril! Are we to stand idly by and watch it fall, o’ great Delfador?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I’m not “The Great” anymore, $horselord_name. Was I ever? Everything I ever achieved was either a lie or has already been undone."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Our company is strong, but what power have we to lay low the walls of Weldyn? To wreak fire and lightning through the streets until finally I excise the festering boil at the heart of all this madness? If only."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "se",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I was warned about this... <i>“Bestow not destruction, but the gleaming light of truth instead”</i>; <i>“the line of kings sundered”</i> — what can the seer have been referring to if not my attack on Arand? Even now, still I understand nothing! <i>“From the barren throne will rise an angel of ashes”</i> — <i>“The nameless son and the ashen daughter”</i> — what nightmares are these that are prophesied to arise from my failure? The coming years will be dark indeed."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Oh seer, what I would give for another chance! I obeyed my friend, and in doing so betrayed him! And now there is nothing left."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Methor",
            type: "Mage of Light",
            side: 2,
            x: 0,
            y: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Methor",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Methor",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "nw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Delfador, I have found you at last! “Nothing left?” There’s no need to be so glum."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Master!? I’d no idea you survived the coup! But you come far too late. I fear it’s all already over."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Methor",
            x: 11,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("I heard your earlier words to the horselord. Do not think of giving up!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("The boy I raised always sought the approval of others: from your peers, from your master, from your king. Now the darkness rings close, and at last you are alone — even I have grown old, and can speak for you no longer."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("The time has come to choose. Who are you, Delfador? Are you nobody; a tired young student; a hanger-on fawning at the feet of his betters? Or are you Delfador the Great, no-one’s servant and his own man! CHOOSE, apprentice!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Look, Methor, it’s not as easy as saying a few words..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Delfador",
            x: 13,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
